      "findings": [
        "September 2 supervision tender provides fresher official procurement confirmation than July 16. Filing/procurement does not establish construction or a granted development/building permit.",
        "July DC1 EPC scope is about 55,200 sqm. September supervision scope gives computing-center 61,700 sqm within broader phase1 total 79,800 sqm; 7,900 sqm substation and about 10,000 sqm operations building are stated. Preserve these different reported scopes/figures pending reconciliation.",
        "July tender schedules construction October 6, 2026 and completion November 21, 2027. These forecasts are not physical observations.",
        "Exact parcel or named parent-campus numeric geometry was not recovered. Street quadrant alone is insufficient; no intersection point or city centroid proposed.",
        "The related Wujiang government response is signed June 26, 2026 despite July hosting, so it cannot supply a new fresh physical status."
      ],
